WEBVTT

00:15:29.563 --> 00:15:31.879
that physics isn't out there
with weird people

00:15:31.903 --> 00:15:33.383
and strange hieroglyphics

00:15:33.407 --> 00:15:35.029
for somebody else in a posh lab.

00:15:35.053 --> 00:15:38.103
Physics is right here; it's for us,
and we can all play with it.

00:15:38.127 --> 00:15:39.293
Thank you very much.

00:15:39.317 --> 00:15:41.317
(Applause)